{"id":3265290,"shortDescription":"Swan Song es un juego de rompecabezas acogedor y emotivo. Utiliza notas de diferentes formas y tamaños para programar una caja de música y resolver cada rompecabezas. Ayuda al cisne a llegar a la salida mientras descubres una conmovedora historia sobre la familia, la pérdida y el dolor.","developers":["Business Goose Studios"],"publishers":["Business Goose Studios","Minimap"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Subtítulos disponibles","Alternativas de color","Controles de volumen personalizados","#category_playable_at_your_own_pace","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"4 JUN 2026","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/f5f4dc486c67588a6f7a4cb63e7ba582b788e8d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1793693576","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/9902497ec49b501134a350eff35c6b86af02ec32/ss_9902497ec49b501134a350eff35c6b86af02ec32.600x338.jpg?t=1793693576","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/9902497ec49b501134a350eff35c6b86af02ec32/ss_9902497ec49b501134a350eff35c6b86af02ec32.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793693576"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/2da3804f4e06d9c917f25e1a0ec1f817ac29ca2d/ss_2da3804f4e06d9c917f25e1a0ec1f817ac29ca2d.600x338.jpg?t=1793693576","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/2da3804f4e06d9c917f25e1a0ec1f817ac29ca2d/ss_2da3804f4e06d9c917f25e1a0ec1f817ac29ca2d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793693576"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/43aada0ae86fe32cd151f0f083ab9e1f06b68e93/ss_43aada0ae86fe32cd151f0f083ab9e1f06b68e93.600x338.jpg?t=1793693576","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/43aada0ae86fe32cd151f0f083ab9e1f06b68e93/ss_43aada0ae86fe32cd151f0f083ab9e